/tmp/sv-cddfe550c9a54e02a88313388b138315/UniversityCourseCatalog

It uses Static SSR (no interactivity). The existing project has the standard template files. I need you to:

1. Create directories: Models/ and Services/ under the project root
2. Create model files
3. Create the service
4. Update Program.cs
5. Delete Weather.razor
6. Update layout and nav
7. Create all pages
8. Clean up CSS
9. Create AGENTS.md
10. Build and verify

Here are the exact files to create/modify:

## Step 1: Create Models

**Models/Department.cs:**
